#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:5
#: 5bb722ecb98b4086bd710e35372b7dd0
msgid "Archived: Hoverthings Flip Sport Quadcopter"
msgstr "已存档：Hoverthings Flip Sport 四旋翼"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:9
#: fe52e34a85654ff4bb69b6473f6a0de0
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已存档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:11
#: 6ad3d423c69c40cca790ceb91a070a50
msgid ""
"The frame is no longer in production/available for purchase. Some of the "
"instructions cover PX4FMU/PX4IO, which is no longer supported."
msgstr "该机架已停止生产/无法购买。部分说明涉及 PX4FMU/PX4IO，该产品已不再受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:14
#: 95f3b30388da4c17a2333903cc8fc7b0
msgid ""
"The Hoverthings FLIP Sport is very easy to build resulting in a remarkably "
"sturdy and very high performance little quadcopter. The FLIP Sport is well "
"suited to FPV and GoPro photography and videography and can even incorporate"
" a brushless gimbal."
msgstr ""
"Hoverthings FLIP Sport 非常容易组装，最终形成一架非常坚固且性能卓越的小型四旋翼。FLIP Sport 非常适合 FPV 和 "
"GoPro 摄影摄像，甚至可以整合无刷云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:23
#: af1033a5ed20474abb4f2cdb47c23b3e
msgid "Why a FLIP Sport?"
msgstr "为什么选择 FLIP Sport？"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:25
#: 5132646f518f4d3389ebabf6437061aa
msgid ""
"The easiest inexpensive high quality build your own project is either the "
"F330 or 450 DJI FlameWheel QuadCopter."
msgstr "最容易、性价比最高的高质量自制项目是 F330 或 450 DJI FlameWheel 四旋翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:27
#: f711ecd82f58450abdbf292dc72673cd
msgid ""
"The F330 build is detailed elsewhere and the F450 is pretty much identical."
msgstr "F330 的组装在其他地方有详细介绍，F450 的组装几乎相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:29
#: e8eb64bb9c574dd5a8804e7aac7f2415
msgid ""
"I really love those little FlameWheels for delivering many hours of fun and "
"resisting my every effort to destroy them."
msgstr "我真的很喜欢那些小 FlameWheel，它们带来了无数小时的乐趣，并抵抗了我每一次损坏它们的尝试。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:31
#: 4b4e863ae3394cb88acaf9d1ae011b9f
msgid ""
"This time I thought I'd try and kick it up a notch, something even more "
"indestructible and maybe even more fun."
msgstr "这次我想尝试更进一步，寻找更坚不可摧、也许更有趣的东西。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:33
#: 1472fa1f78ed4bfba5f58693843b0a81
msgid "The Flip frame kit is $89.00 from Hoverthings."
msgstr "Flip 机架套件从 Hoverthings 购买售价 89 美元。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:34
#: a3ab1c401fbd4566be2592e59eca53a2
msgid ""
"In addition to the standard Sport frame kit I also purchased an extended tab"
" pair of center frame pieces and some extra 7/8\" stand offs."
msgstr "除标准 Sport 机架套件外，我还购买了一对带延伸接耳的中心机架件和一些额外的 7/8 英寸支柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:37
#: 95a97b039c7c4e4a9fe6f7b213392b4d
msgid ""
"It is billed as being nearly indestructible and short of direct Nuclear "
"blast effects, they are probably right."
msgstr "它被宣传为几乎坚不可摧，除了直接的核爆影响，他们可能是对的。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:39
#: 2b08e9b8ac6d4a4fa430ddfb855ba4a6
msgid ""
"The frame arms on these Flips are billed as being incredibly stiff and "
"incredibly strong."
msgstr "这些 Flip 机架臂被宣传为极其刚硬和强度极高。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:41
#: a4bb9b278a254dda9b8f708661a402c1
msgid ""
"The arms are CNC milled high density 1/4\" thick fiberglass and are very "
"stiff, they should be able to withstand a lot of punishment."
msgstr "机架臂由 CNC 铣削的 1/4 英寸厚高密度玻璃纤维制成，非常坚硬，应能承受大量冲击。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:43
#: 867a820dd22245598bf69bf466e0ca08
msgid ""
"The frame centers are also very strong and stiff fiberglass and it it seems "
"likely all of it is G10."
msgstr "机架中心部分同样非常坚固的玻璃纤维制成，看起来很可能全部是 G10 材质。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:45
#: 1e5a15378a64489cae031d446fa337e5
msgid ""
"This is a small 380 size frame and will accommodate 10\" propellers (Right "
"between the Flamewheel F330 and F450.)"
msgstr "这是一款 380 尺寸的小型机架，可安装 10 英寸螺旋桨（介于 Flamewheel F330 和 F450 之间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:52
#: c659ac47140141c0a8648173933e2cd2
msgid "What to get"
msgstr "需要什么"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:54
#: f08b4f4f18d044018bc980c43ce52aaa
msgid ""
"A `Hoverthings Flip Sport Frame <https://www.amazon.com/HoverThings-Flip-"
"Frame-Black-Orange/dp/B00HZTN6GO/>`__ (approx $89.00 USD)."
msgstr ""
"一个 `Hoverthings Flip Sport 机架 <https://www.amazon.com/HoverThings-Flip-"
"Frame-Black-Orange/dp/B00HZTN6GO/>`__ （约 89 美元）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:59
#: d6db19305c77416280a3f543d4d737b9
msgid ""
"`Two tabbed center sections <hhttp://www.hoverthings.com/flip4tabblack>`__ "
"and *eight 7/8\" standoffs* (e.g. `similar to these "
"<http://hoverthings.com/standoff-nylon-f-f/>`__)."
msgstr ""
"`两个带接耳的中心板 <hhttp://www.hoverthings.com/flip4tabblack>`__ 和*八个 7/8 英寸支柱*（例如 "
"`类似这些 <http://hoverthings.com/standoff-nylon-f-f/>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:60
#: 479a0d9e45164f70bd879f6518acfecd
msgid ""
"Four DJI motors for Flamewheel from `Amain Hobby "
"<https://www.amainhobbies.com/dji-multirotor-replacement-brushless-motor-"
"dji-motor01/p235238>`__ for $24.00 each."
msgstr ""
"四个 DJI Flamewheel 电机，来自 `Amain Hobby <https://www.amainhobbies.com/dji-"
"multirotor-replacement-brushless-motor-dji-motor01/p235238>`__，每个 24 美元。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:62
#: a3163295948a4273867ffa1d9d40656d
msgid ""
"A 20 or 25 Amp four in one ESC from `Off the Grid Water "
"<http://mymobilemms.com/OFFTHEGRIDWATER.CA/ESC/4-in-1-Speed-Control-Quad-"
"HOBBYWING-Quattro-Skywalker-25A-X-41?cPath=2_4>`__ for $40.00."
msgstr ""
"一个 20 或 25 安培四合一 ESC，来自 `Off the Grid Water "
"<http://mymobilemms.com/OFFTHEGRIDWATER.CA/ESC/4-in-1-Speed-Control-Quad-"
"HOBBYWING-Quattro-Skywalker-25A-X-41?cPath=2_4>`__，售价 40 美元。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:64
#: db24240334374f149f076cc2441ce4b5
msgid "A :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>` compatible autopilot."
msgstr "一个 :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>` 兼容飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:65
#: accb46cbccc64692a73435739821d63e
msgid ""
"A :ref:`GPS and Compass Module <common-positioning-landing-page>` module."
msgstr "一个 :ref:`GPS 和罗盘模块 <common-positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:66
#: 2bc6d840a1174a9ab7d14c62f21d14eb
msgid ""
"Two `normal <https://www.rcdude.com/product-p/gf-1045-c.htm>`__ and two "
"`reverse <https://www.rcdude.com/product-p/gf-1045r-blk.htm>`__ rotation DJI"
" compatible Gemfan 10\" carbon filled propellers from RC Dude."
msgstr ""
"两个 `正转 <https://www.rcdude.com/product-p/gf-1045-c.htm>`__ 和两个 `反转 "
"<https://www.rcdude.com/product-p/gf-1045r-blk.htm>`__ DJI 兼容 Gemfan 10 "
"英寸碳纤维填充螺旋桨，来自 RC Dude。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:70
#: c4d5134649bf4b6b9ba381a202993856
msgid ""
"A 2600 to `4000mah LiPo battery <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-"
"battery-nano-tech-4000mah-3s-25-50c-lipo-pack-xt-60.html?___store=en_us>`__ "
"that fits between the 2 bottom plates."
msgstr ""
"一块 2600 至 `4000mah LiPo 电池 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-battery-"
"nano-tech-4000mah-3s-25-50c-lipo-pack-"
"xt-60.html?___store=en_us>`__，可放入两块底板之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:72
#: b2b6d0c7a99040f19a1e643c2b9d056d
msgid ""
"PPM-Sum compatible receiver that works with your RC transmitter: `FRSky "
"<http://www.valuehobby.com/radio-systems-servos/receivers/frsky-receiver-"
"telemetry.html>`__\\ `(Delta 8) <http://www.valuehobby.com/frysky-"
"delta-8.html>`__, Futaba SBus or Spektrum satellite recommended."
msgstr ""
"与您遥控器兼容的 PPM-Sum 接收机：推荐使用 `FRSky <http://www.valuehobby.com/radio-systems-"
"servos/receivers/frsky-receiver-telemetry.html>`__\\ `（Delta 8） "
"<http://www.valuehobby.com/frysky-delta-8.html>`__、Futaba SBus 或 Spektrum "
"卫星接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:76
#: c28dcf09cd694c07ace85b4cf6b4d4ce
msgid ""
"For a PX4 system: A `Pad of Kyousho Zeal Antivibration gel "
"<https://www.amainhobbies.com/kyosho-zeal-vibration-absorption-gyro-"
"reciever-mounting-gel-1-sheet-kyoz8006/p19713>`__ and four nylon or aluminum"
" 1 1/2\" threaded standoffs."
msgstr ""
"对于 PX4 系统：一片 `Kyousho Zeal 减振胶垫 <https://www.amainhobbies.com/kyosho-zeal-"
"vibration-absorption-gyro-reciever-mounting-gel-1-sheet-kyoz8006/p19713>`__ "
"和四个尼龙或铝制 1.5 英寸螺纹支柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:83
#: d9ab238d9c004857afdf7632051190aa
msgid "Assembling the frame"
msgstr "组装机架"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:85
#: a09458e65db242b99fbd9ff0100e4b96
msgid ""
"There are two different construction methods depending on whether you are "
"using a Pixhawk or a PX4FMU/PX4IO."
msgstr "根据您使用的是 Pixhawk 还是 PX4FMU/PX4IO，有两种不同的组装方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:87
#: 4e87dbf2de3b40738490254e530d3024
msgid ""
"For the Pixhawk you will use the second untabbed center plate on top as "
"shown above, for a PX4FMU/PX4IO you will not."
msgstr "对于 Pixhawk，您将使用第二块无接耳的中心板作为顶板（如上图所示），对于 PX4FMU/PX4IO 则不使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:89
#: ba0e9823323e4fc6bf60f2071e23b983
msgid ""
"Construction procedure is as follows (Use blue Locktite on all machine "
"screws.)"
msgstr "组装步骤如下（所有机器螺丝使用蓝色螺纹锁固剂）："

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:91
#: 526364c72bc843fe9b9a254925aaad5b
msgid ""
"Assemble the 2 tabbed center sections with four 7/8\" standoffs on the 2 "
"holes an inch apart 2\" in from the end on 2 opposing sides."
msgstr "用四个 7/8 英寸支柱将 2 块带接耳的中心板在两个对边端部内 2 英寸处相距 1 英寸的 2 个孔上组装在一起。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:93
#: 4e8bb3da947a4df49bf6a4ee08ec98ef
msgid ""
"Mount the arms to the top of one of the tabbed center frames using the short"
" standoffs above the arm and use locktite."
msgstr "将机架臂安装到其中一个带接耳中心板的顶部，在臂上方使用短支柱并使用螺纹锁固剂。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:96
#: d43b520872a545b59e3fb42e43cccc49
msgid ""
"Ensure that the standoffs mounting the two tabbed frame sections are on "
"either side of your copter, not front to back."
msgstr "确保连接两个带接耳机架板的支柱位于飞机两侧，而非前后方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:98
#: b76ea64576da4fccb3fb17435a284d0a
msgid ""
"Put the longer screws up through the tabbed plate and arms (2 on the outside"
" 1 in the middle towards the middle) into the short standoffs."
msgstr "将较长的螺丝从下向上穿过带接耳板和机架臂（外侧 2 个，中间靠近中心 1 个）拧入短支柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:102
#: 884212a94e624c54a23565df51708d90
msgid ""
"Insert and your four in one ESC in between the arms with the excess Motor "
"wire wrapped around the ESC"
msgstr "将四合一 ESC 插入机架臂之间，多余的电机线缠绕在 ESC 上"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:105
#: acd35f36871d4120878c6369dd4c9464
msgid ""
"Leave about 3 inches of the 3 ESC motor wires sticking out under each arm (I"
" also braided each motors wires on mine.)"
msgstr "在每根臂下方留出约 3 英寸的 3 根 ESC 电机线（我在我的飞机上还对每个电机的线进行了编织）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:107
#: 58e00a7a779c444caa2521c41574945d
msgid ""
"Leave the ESC signal wires and power leads sticking out the back (between "
"the 2 black arms on mine.)."
msgstr "让 ESC 信号线和电源引线从后方伸出（在我的飞机上是从两根黑色臂之间伸出）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:110
#: e484041dcf4a489fbe5026224f77f628
msgid ""
"Put an untabbed frame plate on top of your frame and secure with 12 screws "
"to the top of the standoffs."
msgstr "将一块无接耳机架板放在机架顶部，用 12 颗螺丝固定到支柱顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:112
#: 265b4a0ff4294dcfa59ff7b32a5b93ee
msgid ""
"Install your DJI motors onto the frame arms with the supplied screws (use "
"Locktite) with the motor wires facing the copter."
msgstr "使用随附螺丝（涂抹螺纹锁固剂）将DJI电机安装到机架臂上，电机导线朝向飞机内侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:114
#: 0469a6c11c6e47ffab9b6f4386327280
msgid ""
"Thread the motor wires through the top frame arm opening and connect to the "
"ESC wires (tuck excess lead into frame)."
msgstr "将电机导线穿过机架臂顶部开口，连接到ESC导线（将多余导线塞入机架内）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:121
#: 762da7d973264d86944cb83ff6374541
msgid "Installing the Pixhawk autopilot"
msgstr "安装Pixhawk飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:123
#: 62577bde24e94828a7d8a99c36e08c6d
msgid ""
"If you are using a Pixhawk, mount the 4 remaining 7/8\" long standoffs, "
"directly over the ones securing the bottom frame plates."
msgstr "如果您使用的是Pixhawk，请将4个剩余的7/8英寸长螺柱直接安装在固定底板的螺柱正上方。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:125
#: 5f339b780ce7447c8ae0c2a085e29051
msgid ""
"Place a 1\" square of the Double-sided foam tape that came with the Pixhawk "
"on the bottom of it at each corner."
msgstr "在Pixhawk底部四个角各粘贴一块1英寸正方形的双面泡沫胶带（随Pixhawk附带）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:127
#: 167e13081fab45f6afebdf71d2633537
msgid ""
"Adhere the Pixhawk to the top of the frame with the arrow pointing to the "
"front (between the 2 orange arms on mine)."
msgstr "将Pixhawk粘贴到机架顶部，箭头指向机头方向（在我的机架上，位于2个橙色臂之间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:129
#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:179
#: 4a4d9379989d41ad8f38a61adb8eb5e1 8d3f39a501d24f8c8fc3bdba10e147c9
msgid ""
"Drill a hole through the top 2 frame plates near a frame arm near the edge "
"on one side to accommodate the \"safety\" button."
msgstr "在顶部2块机架板靠近一侧边缘的机架臂附近钻孔，以容纳\"安全\"按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:131
#: 7aa4359420504eadbfce54d84b67ec03
msgid ""
"Also mount the buzzer on the top frame member on one side where it will not "
"interfere with a receiver installation."
msgstr "同时将蜂鸣器安装在顶部机架件的一侧，确保不妨碍接收机的安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:133
#: 1ca2ba3c21fb4ddd8f339b55c4f25ceb
msgid ""
"Connect the 3DR power module to the Pixhawk connector and attach the power "
"module out of the way also."
msgstr "将3DR电源模块连接到Pixhawk接口，并将电源模块固定在不碍事的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:135
#: df66af13e62749fbaec9ee74514e1a8b
msgid ""
"Solder the other end of the power module wires into a battery connector "
"along with the ESC battery leads."
msgstr "将电源模块另一端的导线与ESC电池导线一同焊接到电池连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:137
#: 95e38d6f0ce24504bab68127d1a98425
msgid ""
"Install the ESC's signal leads into the Pixhawk (Main Out) servo connectors "
"(signal wire on top)."
msgstr "将ESC的信号线插入Pixhawk（Main Out）舵机接口（信号线在上方）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:140
#: 1758a7998838488ab01f5bbc6ee0a3e1
msgid ""
"Red wire into 1, Orange into 2, White into 3 (with red and black below) and "
"Brown into 4."
msgstr "红线插1号，橙线插2号，白线插3号（红黑线在下方），棕线插4号。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:143
#: 7a88a355323e42adb38c646dec7d9bab
msgid ""
"Install the GPS and compass wires into the GPS/Compass module and the "
"Pixhawk."
msgstr "将GPS和罗盘导线连接到GPS/罗盘模块及Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:145
#: d3f0ae5780f74d2a88cbbefd7057fbf8
msgid ""
"Mount your receiver with double sided tape or Velcro on the top frame member"
" to one side of (and not touching) the Pixhawk."
msgstr "用双面胶带或魔术贴将接收机固定在顶部机架件上，位于Pixhawk一侧（但不接触Pixhawk）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:148
#: 1398994916c84a6f9788796949e7f91e
msgid ""
"Run a single servo lead from the PPM-Sum output of the receiver to the left "
"side (RC) input of the Pixhawk."
msgstr "从接收机的PPM-Sum输出端连接一根单独的舵机线到Pixhawk左侧（RC）输入端。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:150
#: 1d4e8476891c446d928c222bbaad27b6
msgid ""
"Or if it is a Spektrum Satellite run the Spektrum receiver lead to the "
"Spektrum socket on top of the Pixhawk."
msgstr "如果使用Spektrum卫星接收机，则将Spektrum接收机导线连接到Pixhawk顶部的Spektrum接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:153
#: 22c21154c8a74d3eaccda26205dd6c34
msgid ""
"Mount the top untabbed frame member over the Pixhawk to the 7/8\" standoffs "
"you already installed above."
msgstr "将无卡口的顶部机架件安装到已安装好的7/8英寸螺柱上方，盖住Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:155
#: 118df61191274036a64ee1b81f5d691e
msgid ""
"Mount the GPS module to the top center of the top frame plate using double "
"sided tape."
msgstr "用双面胶带将GPS模块固定在顶板的顶部中央。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:159
#: 95226b91b68f4ee0ba301faa1dbfcb22
msgid "Installing the PX4FMU/PX4IO autopilot"
msgstr "安装PX4FMU/PX4IO飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:161
#: fffc83dc3ca545c882b21a9ee6aed201
msgid ""
"If you are using a PX4 we can't use the top frame plate but can construct a "
"little hard top if desired."
msgstr "如果您使用PX4，则无法使用顶部机架板，但可以根据需要制作一个小型硬顶盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:163
#: ab38c71ff0294e188db3b09a808e188b
msgid ""
"Cut a 2\" by 2\" rectangle from scrap plastic or fiberglass to support the "
"PX4FMU/PX4IO."
msgstr "从废旧塑料或玻璃纤维上裁出一块2英寸×2英寸的矩形板，用于支撑PX4FMU/PX4IO。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:165
#: 796a61c0e1be4eeab3d2fec6f7bd9ee1
msgid ""
"Drill 4 holes in the rectangle that line up with the mounting hole in the "
"PX4 board (roughly centered)"
msgstr "在矩形板上钻4个与PX4板安装孔对齐的孔（大致居中）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:167
#: 935e591dd924472e938aa098ba276c66
msgid ""
"using 4 of the supplied black screws, mount 4 standoffs to the rectangle."
msgstr "使用4颗随附的黑色螺丝，将4个螺柱固定到矩形板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:169
#: 6e7b821170fe445a9a5f28f15dc250c8
msgid ""
"Insert the PX4FMU board (connector side up) over the 4 standoff studs and "
"(carefully) screw 4 more standoffs over them."
msgstr "将PX4FMU板（接口面朝上）套入4个螺柱上，然后（小心地）在其上拧紧4个螺柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:171
#: 19cd4a59ebda47ffa84e2004a4d0e4ef
msgid ""
"Carefully fasten 4 nuts over the exposed studs securing the PX4FMU/PX4IO "
"modules to the rectangle you made."
msgstr "小心地将4个螺母拧到外露螺柱上，将PX4FMU/PX4IO模块固定到您制作的矩形板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:173
#: 101e6019840242afab958be15e99be07
msgid ""
"Place the PX4IO board over the PX4FMU board so that the connector is aligned"
" and push down over the studs."
msgstr "将PX4IO板放置在PX4FMU板上方，使接口对齐，然后向下压到螺柱上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:175
#: a80a95331e2244e588f9e9ed6e1182fc
msgid ""
"Place a 3/4\" square piece of the Kyosho zeal at each edge of the "
"\"rectangle\" between the standoff screws."
msgstr "在\"矩形板\"四个角的螺柱螺丝之间各放一块3/4英寸正方形的Kyosho zeal减震垫。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:177
#: da7c3d9e9a0249f78f0e4e49621fa488
msgid ""
"Adhere the rectangle to the center of the top of the frame with the servo "
"connector facing to the rear (between the black frame arms)."
msgstr "将矩形板粘贴到机架顶部中央，舵机接口朝向机尾（位于黑色机架臂之间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:181
#: 09279c4bd0dd45ff8cc05319297e3871
msgid ""
"Also mount the buzzer on the top frame member behind the PX4FMU/PX4IO stack "
"such that it does not touch the \"rectangle\"."
msgstr "同时将蜂鸣器安装在PX4FMU/PX4IO叠层后方的顶部机架件上，确保不接触\"矩形板\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:183
#: 6d71ffcadf6246e98723e41cd41912db
msgid ""
"Insert the power connector into the PX4IO board and solder the power leads "
"and the ESC power leads to a battery connector."
msgstr "将电源连接器插入PX4IO板，并将电源导线和ESC电源导线焊接到电池连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:185
#: 4c764adb97f54768940c7c7f59254d60
msgid "Connect the buzzer and \"Safety\" button leads to the PX4FMU/PX4IO boards."
msgstr "将蜂鸣器和\"安全\"按钮导线连接到PX4FMU/PX4IO板。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:186
#: 971c9dfa0e034a49b236000bd40b1654
msgid ""
"Install the ESC's signal leads into the PX4IO board servo connectors (signal"
" wire on top)."
msgstr "将ESC的信号线插入PX4IO板的舵机接口（信号线在上方）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:190
#: 1f8313e4e4734d3e8ddce99e3b09ebc7
msgid ""
"Red wire = right pins, Orange = 2nd from right, White = 3rd from right (with"
" red and black below) and Brown = 4 from right."
msgstr "红线=最右侧引脚，橙线=右数第2个，白线=右数第3个（红黑线在下方），棕线=右数第4个。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:193
#: 655a025e6f7b4698be7ee872e4111dde
msgid ""
"Mount your receiver with double sided tape or Velcro on the top frame member"
" to one side of (and not touching) the \"rectangle\"."
msgstr "用双面胶带或魔术贴将接收机固定在顶部机架件上，位于\"矩形板\"一侧（但不接触\"矩形板\"）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:196
#: 909ee67fd8a8441d9ce4122f4d74ce0e
msgid ""
"Ensure that your receiver does not block the USB connector on the side of "
"the PX4FMU board (put it on the other side)."
msgstr "确保接收机不会遮挡PX4FMU板侧面的USB接口（将接收机安装在另一侧）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:198
#: b40019df6f75435d8c03b61bc29508c9
msgid ""
"Run a single servo lead from the PPM-Sum output of the receiver to the far "
"left side of the PX4IO servo connector."
msgstr "从接收机的PPM-Sum输出端连接一根单独的舵机线到PX4IO舵机接口的最左侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:200
#: 8e46a75a818444ad9794dce736633a44
msgid ""
"Or if it is a Spektrum Satellite receiver run the Spektrum receiver lead to "
"the Spektrum socket on top of the Pixhawk."
msgstr "如果使用Spektrum卫星接收机，则将Spektrum接收机导线连接到Pixhawk顶部的Spektrum接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:203
#: 0f880f396f6a4c1480fd1714665c2e1c
msgid ""
"To use the remaining frame plate as a top cover screw the 4 standoffs to the"
" top of the frame using existing holes near the edge."
msgstr "要将剩余的机架板用作顶盖，请使用现有的靠近边缘的孔将4个螺柱拧到机架顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:206
#: 9bd0030f956f4981af9a1e3d983902d8
msgid "Screw the plate to the 4 standoffs."
msgstr "将机架板拧到4个螺柱上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:208
#: 071b884a2b1d4fc1b94a7d687b0a5c19
msgid ""
"You can make your own top cover from a rectangle of plastic or fiberglass (I"
" used Plexiglass, transparent is useful)."
msgstr "您可以用塑料或玻璃纤维矩形板自制顶盖（我使用了亚克力板，透明材质非常实用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:211
#: c3ecb65f5be741688945cfb4cd5edf64
msgid ""
"Ensure that the rectangle is of appropriate size and shape to permit you to "
"secure the standoffs to the top plate."
msgstr "确保矩形板的尺寸和形状合适，能够让您将螺柱固定到顶板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:213
#: 339edd6502374171acf19da94ee20957
msgid ""
"Drill holes in the rectangle at the appropriate locations and if needed into"
" the top frame member as well."
msgstr "在矩形板的适当位置钻孔，如有需要，也在顶部机架件上钻孔。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:215
#: bef037917763470e954aa3faf0d250a1
msgid ""
"Attach the standoffs to the top frame member and to the Rectangular top you "
"have made."
msgstr "将螺柱固定到顶部机架件和您制作的矩形顶盖上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:218
#: 0cc3d175074c4ef7a7ee96ed3c06ad3e
msgid ""
"Adhere the GPS/Compass module to the center of the top of the top cover (it "
"doesn't matter which way it is facing)."
msgstr "将GPS/罗盘模块粘贴到顶盖的顶部中央（朝向任何方向均可）。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:221
#: e9dc00e88aa64abeb8d116d0b9d7c940
msgid ""
"Connect the GPS / Compass module to the PX4IO with the supplied wiring "
"cables."
msgstr "使用随附的连接线将GPS/罗盘模块连接到PX4IO。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:223
#: cd384e460f954f0aae0f262e2b607ea9
msgid ""
"Note my setup uses an older style UBlox standalone GPS which I have mounted "
"directly to the PX4 stack."
msgstr "请注意，我的设置使用的是旧款UBlox独立GPS，我将其直接安装在PX4叠层上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:234
#: e6964061f4e2403e9aebab54b4234783
msgid "Final assembly"
msgstr "最终组装"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:236
#: 297dfb13abf044e38247bf01f5f522c4
msgid ""
"Mount the battery between the lower frame sections and secure it with a "
"Velcro strap inserted through the bottom frame plate slots."
msgstr "将电池安装在下层机架段之间，并用穿过底板槽口的魔术贴绑带固定。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:238
#: 7834c2a84d3442cda3a91dece1b29103
msgid ""
"Route and secure the wires and cables with Zip Ties as shown to prevent "
"snagging on the propellers or anything else."
msgstr "如图所示，用扎带整理并固定导线和线缆，防止其缠绕到螺旋桨或其他部件上。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:240
#: 262ca71d3fa54cb68ad16d279cd91577
msgid ""
"Ensure that the battery cable is secure but accessible to be plugged in when"
" needed."
msgstr "确保电池线缆固定牢靠，但在需要时可以方便地插拔。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:248
#: a3df6789e38140edaaf91f3b8e39135c
msgid "Setup and additions"
msgstr "设置与扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:250
#: 65d648fba15340ca936d19bb644b3fee
msgid ""
"Your Flip can now be configured as described elsewhere in this wiki for "
"Pixhawk."
msgstr "您的Flip现在可以按照本wiki中其他地方针对Pixhawk的说明进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:252
#: 32755d874fdc4aca8ab8fa8a2cd99f51
msgid ""
"There is space for a 3DR telemetry radio and / or an OSD and FPV transmitter"
" between the 2 side tabs."
msgstr "两侧卡口之间有空间可安装3DR数传电台和/或OSD及FPV发射器。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:255
#: 1e62baedfd874d128b1749ebd767633d
msgid ""
"An FPV camera may easily be mounted in front of the battery between the 2 "
"front tabs."
msgstr "FPV摄像头可方便地安装在电池前方、两个前卡口之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:257
#: 452a2a4c5abb4fdd96df4d1bfeb72d03
msgid ""
"If you use FPV keep its transmitter and antenna well away from the GPS."
msgstr "如果使用FPV，请将其发射器和天线远离GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:260
#: fc214405b8a54c5bbfb3aa735c79352a
msgid ""
"The Flip has more than adequate power to support a GoPro camera with a "
"brushless gimbal and the necessary extended landing gear."
msgstr "Flip有足够的动力来支撑带无刷云台的GoPro摄像头及所需的加长起落架。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:262
#: 59f0112e03d14f0aa9043d25d4e25591
msgid ""
"I have had several crashes and only managed to break 2 props while trying "
"(unsuccessfully) to cut down a 80' bull pine tree with them."
msgstr "我经历了几次坠机，只试图（未成功地）用螺旋桨砍倒一棵80英尺高的松树时损坏了2片桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter.rst:264
#: 574ebae5223140fea20974880839aaa7
msgid ""
"This little copter is very high performance, fully acrobatic, surprisingly "
"efficient and nearly indestructible and it is a blast to fly."
msgstr "这款小型飞机性能卓越、完全适合特技飞行、效率出奇地高、几乎坚不可摧，飞起来非常过瘾。"
